 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.what",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.2,
   "text": "What if every lie you heard smelled of burnt toast."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.maths",
   "start": 2.2,
   "end": 3.9,
   "text": "It started in maths, on a Tuesday."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.teach",
   "start": 3.9,
   "end": 5.7667,
   "text": "My teacher said she liked my handwriting."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.smell",
   "start": 5.7667,
   "end": 7.7333,
   "text": "The whole room smelled like a toaster on fire."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hair",
   "start": 7.7333,
   "end": 9.7333,
   "text": "My friend said my haircut was good. Toast."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.dad",
   "start": 9.7333,
   "end": 12.7667,
   "text": "My dad said he would come on Sunday. The kitchen filled with it."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.rule",
   "start": 12.7667,
   "end": 15.3333,
   "text": "Any lie, from anyone, any size. Always toast."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.limit",
   "start": 15.3333,
   "end": 17.9333,
   "text": "One thing it could not do. It never worked on me."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.class",
   "start": 17.9333,
   "end": 20.9,
   "text": "I knew who broke the window before the teacher did."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.mum",
   "start": 20.9,
   "end": 23.7667,
   "text": "My mum. I wanted to know if she was okay."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.never",
   "start": 23.7667,
   "end": 25.5,
   "text": "And she never smelled of toast."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.fine",
   "start": 25.5,
   "end": 29.3,
   "text": "\"Are you okay?\" \"I'm fine.\" Nothing. Not a crumb of it."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.honest",
   "start": 29.3,
   "end": 33.1,
   "text": "I told my friend my mum was the only honest person in this town."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.silent",
   "start": 33.1,
   "end": 35.9333,
   "text": "He said nothing. Which also smelled of nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sunday",
   "start": 35.9333,
   "end": 39.6333,
   "text": "Then I asked her about my dad."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.coming",
   "start": 39.6333,
   "end": 43.4,
   "text": "\"He's coming on Sunday,\" she said."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.caught",
   "start": 43.4,
   "end": 48.7,
   "text": "Toast. For the first time in my life, from her."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.proud",
   "start": 48.7,
   "end": 54.1667,
   "text": "I was so pleased with myself. I had caught her."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.shout",
   "start": 54.1667,
   "end": 55.7,
   "text": "I did not ask nicely. I did not stop asking."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.wrong",
   "start": 55.7,
   "end": 57.5667,
   "text": "I told her she was a liar, in the kitchen, with the door open."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.win",
   "start": 57.5667,
   "end": 59.3333,
   "text": "I won. I could smell it. I was right, and she was wrong."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.quiet",
   "start": 59.3333,
   "end": 60.3333,
   "text": "She stopped answering me after that."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.lost",
   "start": 60.3333,
   "end": 62.1333,
   "text": "I thought she had run out of lies. She had run out of words."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.friend",
   "start": 62.1333,
   "end": 68.9,
   "text": "My friend said, \"It tells you it is a lie. It does not tell you why.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.gone",
   "start": 68.9,
   "end": 75.5667,
   "text": "He went and sat somewhere else. I could not smell anything on him."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.bday",
   "start": 75.5667,
   "end": 78.5667,
   "text": "My birthday. The whole class. A cake on the front desk."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.cake",
   "start": 78.5667,
   "end": 79.9667,
   "text": "The cake smelled like a fire."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.smile",
   "start": 79.9667,
   "end": 83.6,
   "text": "Every smile. Every happy birthday. All of it, burning."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.stand",
   "start": 83.6,
   "end": 84.9333,
   "text": "So I stood up on my chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.say",
   "start": 84.9333,
   "end": 87.7333,
   "text": "\"You are all lying to me,\" I said. \"Every single one of you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "11.still",
   "start": 87.7333,
   "end": 89.9,
   "text": "The room went quiet. Somebody put a card down."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.mum",
   "start": 89.9,
   "end": 92.5,
   "text": "My mum was in the doorway. She had a card in her hand."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.read",
   "start": 92.5,
   "end": 94.1667,
   "text": "It said, \"Sorry your dad could not come.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "12.room",
   "start": 94.1667,
   "end": 96.5333,
   "text": "And the room was so full of toast smell I could taste it."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.all",
   "start": 96.5333,
   "end": 98.0,
   "text": "They all knew. They had all known for weeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.back",
   "start": 98.0,
   "end": 100.1,
   "text": "Every lie in this school that day was about the same Sunday."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.not",
   "start": 100.1,
   "end": 102.5,
   "text": "Nobody was lying to hurt me. They were lying so I would not know yet."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.mine",
   "start": 102.5,
   "end": 104.6,
   "text": "I could never smell my own. That was the whole trick of it."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.mum",
   "start": 104.6,
   "end": 107.1333,
   "text": "My mum was not honest. She said \"I'm fine\" because it was all she could say."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.det",
   "start": 107.1333,
   "end": 110.2667,
   "text": "It was never a lie detector. It was a kindness detector. I had it backwards."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.smell",
   "start": 110.2667,
   "end": 115.9333,
   "text": "So I sat down and ate cake that tasted of nothing at all."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.truth",
   "start": 115.9333,
   "end": 121.3333,
   "text": "Then I said the first true thing in months. \"I miss him.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "14.sub",
   "start": 121.3333,
   "end": 126.6333,
   "text": "Subscribe if you ever smelled the toast and got it wrong."
  }
 ],
